  "body_html": "<p>Add a powerful and personalized touch to your bedroom decor with this custom trucker comforter set by Jeminise. Featuring a dynamic digital illustration of a semi truck breaking through a stone wall, this bedding set is perfect for truck drivers and vehicle enthusiasts alike. Personalize it with your custom name text to create a truly unique gift or a bold focal point for your own space.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom name text input option to make your trucker bedding truly one-of-a-kind.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is soft, breathable, and lightweight, mimicking the comfort of cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Quality:</strong> Utilizes advanced environmental protection dyeing techniques that hold color and prevent fading, finished with compact edge stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Your choice of a Duvet Cover or Comforter with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; tumble dry on low heat and air dry without heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Cool Black Truck</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
